{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "89773980f950b31f4e21d12876f3fb4f78273b140ae87425d60f8c9a70e52507", "ja": "劇場は広いから、歩いてるだけでも\nいい運動になりそうだな～。", "zh": "剧场很宽敞，光是走走路似乎也能算是不错的运动呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "4b4f12ae580a971fa99695b048a216bcbc4cd3e9e3d856b1f7fcb0be58cc5ec8", "ja": "イチ、ニー、イチ、ニー……\nあっ、{$P$}さ～ん！！", "zh": "一、二，一、二……\n啊，{$P$}先生～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "95c93cd5a4b524c74f8e1ae5de79f533cf8a9d16a40e5470d50e1e4149d652e1", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "48d65b2885a411493258ef369efa74ebe9f69db454ac9a345f72fdddd184a1f6", "ja": "はい！　社長さんが、\n手が空いたら事務所に来てほしいそうです。", "zh": "好的！社长说，有空的话希望您能来一趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "56275cf8581e1596e5f2b2acb62c5cbd59cc2f0dad8f7d06b6863aa1f4514eaa", "ja": "社長が？　わかりました、すぐに行きます！", "zh": "社长？明白了，我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "49ee9cf1583d88f3282b1d3e0644a826bbe897e33b301f057f03cebfe190520e", "ja": "はい！　よろしくお願いします。\n……イチ、ニー！　イチ、ニー！", "zh": "好的！拜托您了。\n……一、二！一、二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4e272234f10d3a45ef72eb46b5cc64c1736526952f3330d6553e3f1db732e6ee", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "20940a3f6cdf301cc7536d50a7dd1df7ed4ce11e9b8d521cd41db6c5661dfadc", "ja": "おお、君！　ちょうどいいところに来たね、\n待って……アチッ、いたよ……アチチッ……！", "zh": "哦，是你！来得正好，\n等等……好烫，疼……好烫……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "e23f564b06812125c2ca753240dda9698a167fc835b92db5720d56343afe7fe5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n焼きイモ、おひとつどうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n要来一个烤红薯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7ebc60695cf51564deb61079cadbe710e8054e508d2bca9615bf2e0bd3f08a26", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n……あっ、でも……。", "zh": "谢谢！\n……啊，不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dd09c811a07e4e01ce992b04c4d33f9a05c417a2c0c95a25b5446c6befe0c7e1", "ja": "青羽さんがあんなに忙しそうに働いてるのに、\n俺だけのんきに焼きイモを食べるというのも……。", "zh": "青羽小姐明明忙得不可开交，我却一个人悠闲地吃烤红薯，总觉得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "3826876e9e3961239a3ecf1963ff473d26334d97157e8cb41c016341c7a182f8", "ja": "青羽君かい？　彼女も、\nさっきここで焼きイモを食べて帰ったよ。", "zh": "是青羽吗？她刚才也在这里吃了烤红薯后回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "f4cf87d4b82dfcf7585ed0d5e92dbf576ad26f462514b53d9e7da2d2e8e3d6a0", "ja": "美咲ちゃん、いつも美味しそうに食べてくれるから。\nつい何かあげたくなっちゃうんですよね……。", "zh": "因为美咲你每次都吃得那么香嘛。总是不由得想给你拿点什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "e030a86b92686a6ea6419193601af2095f00bb1d87bba665981017620785f6e4", "ja": "焼きイモの話はさておき、本題に入ろうか。\n君、『秋』といったら、何を連想するかね？", "zh": "先不说烤红薯，进入正题吧。说到“秋天”，你会联想到什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fdb11ac11e5f4e88d60633e86ceeefd29e91c9d3a2243f1ac46944cd6b4189f6", "ja": "そうですね……。やっぱり食欲の秋とか、\n実りの秋。あとは芸術の秋、でしょうか？", "zh": "是啊……果然还是会想到“食欲之秋”、\n还有“收获之秋”。再就是“艺术之秋”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "25343d7502976deffd59d8719fe4304c8f65299916385631c82d2100de923883", "ja": "う、うむ、それも正解だが……他にもあるだろう？\nほら、『ス』からはじまるアレとか……。", "zh": "唔、唔，那也算正确，但是……应该还有别的吧？\n你看，比如以“斯”开头的那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_1018", "source_sha256": "1e1c12dddab2177d9131df219d637c49bfea3ddf45d616d3f6e2813f97f4591d", "ja": "スポーツの秋！", "zh": "运动之秋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "09fe17e5d191646013750a6b21130c925de0e9e35c22b1739f84bec08365e605", "ja": "ああ！　『スポーツの秋』ですね！", "zh": "啊！就是“运动之秋”嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "01012ef5ca3d27fc866c715ab2d697c478b449d8d446d0b5e678971754f2d4ec", "ja": "そのとおり！　食べ物とスポーツ……\n秋の楽しみといえば、このふたつは外せない！", "zh": "没错！美食和体育……\n说到秋天的乐趣，这两样可少不了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "41bd696a96338ddf75b75a6e042898a64259d2de9c736d021519e0dde0d00420", "ja": "そこで私は考えたのだよ。これらを合体させれば、\n完全無欠の秋のイベントが完成するのではないかとね！", "zh": "于是我就想到，要是把这些合在一起，不就能打造出完美无缺的秋季活动了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "3be76db8bbc2861f511034e065ddd2e87cd8e8abaea6f8d5981e6737bfd02409", "ja": "食欲の秋と、スポーツの秋を……合体！？\nど、どういうことですか……？", "zh": "把美食之秋和运动之秋……合二为一！？\n这、这是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "827c8e8764a41f5665e8e0ab375c9f2b605fbf98b8282a98b6d3d23dae141b5c", "ja": "チームごとの料理対決みたいなものなんですけど、\nただ料理をするだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "这是按队伍进行料理对决之类的活动，不过，不只是做料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2005_101kot", "source_sha256": "c912aea00cf55c249bbaed2c3564e647e5137b7636e978a5836c2a59bc7da7de", "ja": "同時に、いろんな運動競技にも挑戦してもらおう！\nってことらしいですよ。", "zh": "好像是说要在做菜的同时，\n也让大家挑战各种体育竞技项目哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "075fe1d5f81f4ddd14ef4489f9ea8b6f903a47bcc6da8d49f75ce275d819a24d", "ja": "765プロの全アイドルによる、秋の祭典……\n題して、『765プロ　クッキング大運動会』だ！！", "zh": "765艺能全偶像参与的秋季盛典……\n题目就是，《765艺能 料理大运动会》！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "93c6d741be4510e2c86ea57e720dd0694dd8f5bfc59459f44acfd736a42b07bb", "ja": "クッキング大運動会！？\n名前からして、カオスなイベントになりそうな……。", "zh": "烹饪大运动会！？\n光听名字，就感觉会是场混乱的活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "769e2f485dbaed8ddda35356884ddd9790c526db09e22fc17ed6df5d441fb468", "ja": "でもその形式なら、スポーツの得意なアイドルと料理の\n得意なアイドル、どちらにも活躍の場があるし……。", "zh": "不过，要是采用那种形式，擅长运动的偶像和擅长料理的偶像，都有发挥的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2009_p", "source_sha256": "d5a4238ebf9bcc08f156a134c1fd15402866760e777aaa7626de9bf6ca5851a5", "ja": "全員参加のイベントとしては、\n意外と理にかなった形式なのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "作为一场全员参加的活动，这种形式或许意外地很合理呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "abcd0396c7d1ad309336afa5047ff2ca54d81a804cd1e5eac7a801a8c7aead38", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル諸君、それぞれの個性を\n大いに活かしたイベントにしたい！", "zh": "嗯！我希望能办成一个充分发挥\n各位偶像各自个性的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2011_president", "source_sha256": "521ca4039a36376474c1530d02dd2641dca4ee36758d2699d426a966ed9ac2f6", "ja": "このイベント、君に任せても大丈夫かね？", "zh": "这个活动，交给你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2012_p", "source_sha256": "17a3cc333ffb50d082b8bdb2c4e479b439756fc4c22a25eb5871f966bb025606", "ja": "わかりました！　せっかくなので芸術の秋も\n取り入れて、秋を満喫できるイベントにしてみせます！", "zh": "明白了！难得有这个机会，我会融入艺术之秋的元素，打造一个能尽情享受秋天的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2013_101kot", "source_sha256": "b492c90cb01c3da0c3b557d939beb34dafab9936bbe3636d0e214c9c6530312d", "ja": "やる気満々ですね、{$P$}さん！\nけどいったい、どんなイベントになるんでしょう……。", "zh": "干劲十足呢，{$P$}先生！\n不过，到底会是怎样的活动呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2014_president", "source_sha256": "f5a2ce80bc5a1fbe6195cab03671b110e1a17cc545bb76ac52926785047588f0", "ja": "ああ。私も期待で、お腹が鳴って……\nいや、胸が高鳴ってきたよ！", "zh": "啊，我也因为期待，肚子都咕咕叫了……不对，是心里激动起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_intro_2015_p", "source_sha256": "336b1f07f4d1a493871d5a019aea1cbcd2e0156a7ec8ac9fbfd5ed82f057cf1e", "ja": "（劇場をあげての、クッキング大運動会。\n思いっきり楽しいイベントにしないとな……！）", "zh": "（全剧场一起举办的烹饪大运动会。\n一定要把它办成一场尽兴的快乐活动才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
